{
    "background_story": "Loyal, a majestic chestnut mare, was known for her remarkable ability to navigate the rugged terrain of the countryside. Her rider, a skilled data analyst, often took her on long rides to clear his mind and think about his work. One day, while galloping through a particularly scenic meadow, Loyal's rider had an epiphany about a new way to visualize complex data. He envisioned a graph that would display the distribution of values in a dataset, much like the rolling hills and valleys of the landscape they rode through. Upon returning home, he created the first histogram, a breakthrough in data visualization that would change the field forever. Loyal, sensing her rider's excitement, pranced proudly, knowing she had played a part in inspiring his innovation.",
